\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ DPJ Ozawa Wants Kan, Hatoyama To Assume Key Roles In Govt If Elected As PM -Kyodo\b0\par\par\uc2 334 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 September 2010\par 09:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2010, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:27 EDT *DJ  Ozawa Says He Wouldn't Dissolve Lower House For Election At Early Date -Kyodo\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:38 EDT *DJ  Ozawa Suggests Sales Tax Hike A Last Resort To Maintain Social Security -Kyodo\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:51 EDT *DJ  Ozawa: Govt Should Have Policy To Deal With Strong Yen -Nikkei\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:52 EDT *DJ  Ozawa: Monetary Policy Alone Insufficient To Contain Yen's Strength-Nikkei\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:53 EDT *DJ  Ozawa: External Invest 1 Option To Control Yen's Strength-Nikkei\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:54 EDT *DJ  Ozawa: BOJ Shouldn't Be Instructed By Govt Over Financial Policy - Kyodo\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:55 EDT *DJ  Ozawa: Govt Should Be Well Prepared To \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  - Nikkei\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 03:56 EDT *DJ  Ozawa: No Choice But To Consider Increasing JGB Issuance For Extra Stimulus - Nikkei\par \par \uc2 8 Sep 2010 04:39 EDT DJ  Ozawa: \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  Should Be Well Prepared To \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  - Nikkei\par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Democratic Party of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavyweight Ichiro Ozawa said Wednesday that the government's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy arsenal should include the option to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, as conventional monetary policy has its limits, the Nikkei reported.\par \par \uc2 "There is a limit to the effectiveness of monetary policy (versus the strong yen). We should consider \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in markets," Ozawa told a press conference.\par \par \uc2 He added that overseas investment was another strategy the government should be ready to adopt to contend with the yen's rise.\par \par \uc2 On the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Ozawa said it shouldn't be told what to do in matters of monetary policy.\par \par \uc2 Ozawa is running against Prime Minister Naoto Kan for presidency of the DPJ. Should he win, he would almost certainly become prime minister.\par \par \uc2 -Tokyo Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; +81-3-6269-2770\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 September 08, 2010 04:39 ET (08:39 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020100908e698001i1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
