\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK: Japan Ozawa's  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Fury Signifies Nothing - Citi\b0\par\par\uc2 1,590 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 2010\par 04:23\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; \par MarketTalk@dowjones.com \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 0223 GMT [Dow Jones] DPJ power-broker Ozawa aims to oust PM Kan, but even if Ozawa succeeds, Japan will continue to face major challenges to any effective \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite Ozawa's remark Thursday that government "should definitely" stem strong JPY; that's because Ozawa would be constrained by international expectations \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says Osamu Takashima, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Citibank \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy won't change even if a new Ozawa administration takes over, as he will face the same difficulties regarding \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that Kan has." Says chief among them is G20 framework that countries should refrain from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken their own \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While framework could change if USD weakness roils markets, says for now it "doesn't have any serious adverse effect on the global economy." Traders say if government were to go ahead with any unilateral \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it would likely be too small in scale to have major effect.(andrew.monahan@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0223 GMT [Dow Jones] HSI nearly flat at 20,872.68, consolidating after 2-day, 1.6% rally; volume spikes to HK$16.49 billion, but boosted by more than HK$1 billion 